[{"text": "The assembly will hear an address by his", "start": 1.12, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "excellency teneti ma maauo, president", "start": 4.799, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "and minister for foreign affairs and", "start": 8.4, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "immigration of the republic of Kiribati.", "start": 10.559, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "I request protocol to escort his", "start": 15.759, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "excellency and invite him to address the", "start": 18.16, "duration": 5.959}, {"text": "assembly.", "start": 21.119, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 71.52, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "Mr. Secretary General,", "start": 75.36, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "the Excellencies,", "start": 78.0, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "distinguished heads of states and", "start": 80.64, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": "governments,", "start": 82.24, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 83.84, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "in the name of Almighty God in whom we", "start": 86.64, "duration": 6.76}, {"text": "place our trust.", "start": 88.88, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "On behalf of the government and the", "start": 94.24, "duration": 3.839}, {"text": "people of Kiribas,", "start": 95.759, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "I extend our warmest congratulations to", "start": 98.079, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "you, Mr. President, on your election to", "start": 101.6, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "preside and lead this 81st session of", "start": 104.64, "duration": 8.159}, {"text": "the United Nations General Assembly.", "start": 108.799, "duration": 8.401}, {"text": "Gibbus assures you of our full support", "start": 112.799, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "and cooperation as you undertake this", "start": 117.2, "duration": 6.76}, {"text": "important responsibility.", "start": 119.68, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 124.799, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "we meet today at a difficult moment.", "start": 126.96, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Conflicts continue to claim lives and", "start": 131.28, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "displace communities.", "start": 133.68, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "Human rights continue to be violated.", "start": 137.04, "duration": 8.559}, {"text": "Humanitarian crisis persist.", "start": 141.52, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "Development gains are being reversed in", "start": 145.599, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "many parts of the world.", "start": 148.56, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Inequality remains entrenched while", "start": 151.84, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "climate change", "start": 155.28, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "places additional pressure on the", "start": 157.44, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "communities", "start": 160.64, "duration": 3.599}, {"text": "already confronting significant", "start": 162.319, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "development challenges. It is therefore", "start": 164.239, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "fitting that the theme of this 81st", "start": 167.2, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "session is restoring restoring trust", "start": 169.76, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "managing transformation", "start": 173.76, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "a united nations that delivers for", "start": 176.16, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "whole.", "start": 179.44, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "This theme is both timely and relevant.", "start": 181.76, "duration": 9.44}, {"text": "Trust cannot be restored by words alone.", "start": 186.56, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "It must be strengthened through", "start": 191.2, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "implementation,", "start": 192.959, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "accountability and results that improve", "start": 194.72, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "the lives of our people. For Gilibas,", "start": 198.239, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "the theme reaffirms our shared duty to", "start": 202.0, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "strengthen the United Nations and ensure", "start": 205.36, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "it serves everyone.", "start": 209.12, "duration": 7.119}, {"text": "Mr. President, Gibbus is an ocean", "start": 212.879, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "nation.", "start": 216.239, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "We are a big ocean sustainable state.", "start": 217.84, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "Our economy,", "start": 223.2, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "food security, livelihoods,", "start": 225.2, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "culture, and the way of life depend on", "start": 228.56, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "healthy, sustainable marine resources.", "start": 231.28, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "Sustainable management is essential to", "start": 235.36, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "our long-term developments and we call", "start": 238.239, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "for increased efforts and partnership", "start": 241.599, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "partnerships to have agreeable progable", "start": 245.12, "duration": 8.319}, {"text": "progress towards SG14", "start": 249.519, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "which is conserve and sustainably use", "start": 253.439, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "sustainably used oceans, seas and marine", "start": 256.959, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "resources for sustainable development.", "start": 260.239, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "The 2026 sustainable development goals", "start": 263.68, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "report reminds us that our oceans and", "start": 266.639, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "fisheries continue", "start": 269.919, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "to face mounting pressures from over", "start": 272.4, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "fishing, illegal, unreported and", "start": 275.04, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "unregulated fishing, pollution, warming", "start": 278.16, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "and acidification.", "start": 282.4, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "The entry into force of the biod", "start": 284.56, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "diversity beyond national jurisdiction", "start": 286.639, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "agreement marks an important step", "start": 289.28, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "towards stronger and more equitable", "start": 292.32, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "ocean governance. Gilibus is proud to", "start": 295.04, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "have signed and ratified this agreement", "start": 298.4, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "and calls on member states to recognize", "start": 301.6, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "the vital importance of our shared", "start": 304.479, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "oceans and to work collectively to", "start": 307.36, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "translate the agreement's historic", "start": 310.24, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "ambition into histo meaningful global", "start": 312.8, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "action.", "start": 316.72, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Mr. President, the sustainability of our", "start": 318.24, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "ocean and fisheries is closely linked to", "start": 321.6, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "the changing climate and the pressures", "start": 324.72, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "we face on our marine resources are", "start": 327.44, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "increasingly compounded by its impact.", "start": 331.36, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "Climate remains one of the most pressing", "start": 335.6, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "challenges to our developments and the", "start": 338.639, "duration": 8.481}, {"text": "way of life. Sea sea level rise, coastal", "start": 341.52, "duration": 9.76}, {"text": "erosion, saltwater intrusion and extreme", "start": 347.12, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "weather events continue to pressure to", "start": 351.28, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "place pressure on our communities,", "start": 354.88, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "infrastructure, water security and", "start": 357.6, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "livelihoods. The intergovernmental panel", "start": 360.24, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "on climate change six assessment report", "start": 363.199, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "reinforces the agency of these", "start": 367.36, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "challenges and particularly the risk", "start": 369.84, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "faced by small island states through our", "start": 373.44, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "long-term national development vision", "start": 377.12, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "the gibbas vision for 20 years our", "start": 379.84, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "national priorities and the most", "start": 383.199, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "politics we continue to invest in", "start": 385.759, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "resilience infrastructure", "start": 389.199, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "water security, coastal protection,", "start": 391.44, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "disaster preparedness, renew renewable", "start": 394.8, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "energy and communitybased adaptation.", "start": 398.16, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "Our objective is clear to continue", "start": 402.319, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "building a wealthy, healthy and peaceful", "start": 405.36, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "Kiribus where our people can live with", "start": 409.039, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "dignity, in peace and with", "start": 412.4, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "opportunities.", "start": 415.44, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "Renewable energy is increasingly", "start": 417.039, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "important to Kiriba's developments and", "start": 419.36, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "energy access. We therefore see greater", "start": 422.16, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "investment in renewable energy as an", "start": 425.44, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "important opportunity to reduce our", "start": 429.039, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "reliance on imported fossil fuels and", "start": 432.24, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "strengthen the resilience and", "start": 435.52, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "sustainability of our energy sector. But", "start": 437.84, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "national action must be matched by", "start": 442.0, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "international action. We call for", "start": 444.8, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "greater ambition, stronger support for", "start": 447.599, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "adaptation and climate finance that is", "start": 450.72, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "adequate, predictable and accessible,", "start": 453.919, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "particularly for small island developing", "start": 457.84, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "states. Gilas recognizes the importance", "start": 460.56, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "of international law in addressing", "start": 463.84, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "climate change. The International Court", "start": 466.479, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "of Justice Advisory Opinion on Climate", "start": 469.599, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "Change advances climate justice by", "start": 472.88, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "affirming that all states have binding", "start": 476.479, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "duties to protect the climate system and", "start": 479.52, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "achieve deep rapid and sustained", "start": 483.199, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "greenhouse gas reductions consistent", "start": 487.52, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "with limiting warming to 1.5\u00b0", "start": 490.8, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "C. We welcome growing recognition that", "start": 495.039, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "climate resilience must be locally honed", "start": 499.12, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "and driven. The Pacific Resilience", "start": 502.56, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Facility is a Pacific Pacific owned", "start": 505.36, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "mechanism that strengthens the region's", "start": 509.28, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "capacity to finance climate and disaster", "start": 512.56, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "resilience. The Pacific's co-hosting of", "start": 516.32, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "COP 31 with Turkey", "start": 519.519, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "later this year further demonstrates the", "start": 522.479, "duration": 7.441}, {"text": "value of local action. These initiatives", "start": 526.08, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "also show that strong genuine", "start": 529.92, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "partnerships can sustain locally led", "start": 533.279, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "development. Mr. President, partnership", "start": 536.64, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "continues to shape international", "start": 540.399, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "cooperation as we believe that we are", "start": 542.48, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "stronger when we work together. At a", "start": 546.0, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "time when multilateralism", "start": 549.36, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "faces growing challenges, partnership", "start": 551.839, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "remains one of our most powerful", "start": 554.8, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "affirmations of what we can achieve", "start": 557.04, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "collectively. Gilipus reaffirms his", "start": 560.48, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "support for frameworks that embody the", "start": 563.6, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "spirit of partnership including the", "start": 566.64, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "Antigu and Barbuta agenda for seats a", "start": 569.44, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "best and the Pacific for the future", "start": 573.6, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "which provide important foundations for", "start": 577.2, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "strengthened international cooperation", "start": 580.8, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "solidarity and collect collective action", "start": 583.76, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "as the 2030 agenda enters it final is", "start": 587.92, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "partnership must remain central to", "start": 591.839, "duration": 8.081}, {"text": "accelerating SG progress. Gilibus", "start": 594.72, "duration": 8.559}, {"text": "Gilibus recently presented its second", "start": 599.92, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "voluntary national review Vietn", "start": 603.279, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "reaffirming our commitments to the 2030", "start": 606.56, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "agenda. We value our longstanding", "start": 610.399, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "diplomatic relations with traditional", "start": 614.079, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "partners and welcome countries seeking", "start": 616.24, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "new partnerships based on mutual", "start": 619.04, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "respect, shared interest, transparency,", "start": 621.92, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "sovereign equality, and respect for our", "start": 625.92, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "national priorities.", "start": 629.279, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "This year following the submission of", "start": 631.68, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "our second VNRA, my government convened", "start": 634.079, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "its first development partners forum on", "start": 637.76, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Christmas Island or Christmas Island,", "start": 640.959, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "which we highly value as the world's", "start": 643.76, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "largest coral at all and the first", "start": 647.12, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "island to see each new day's sunrise.", "start": 649.92, "duration": 8.56}, {"text": "This forum strengthened partnerships", "start": 655.2, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "between Gilipas and its development", "start": 658.48, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "partners and showcased two flagship", "start": 660.72, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "projects critical to accelerating", "start": 663.92, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "economic growth and sustainable", "start": 666.72, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "development. Participants included", "start": 669.44, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Australia, the the People's Republic of", "start": 672.24, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "China, the European Union, New Zealand,", "start": 675.2, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "Japan, the United States of America, the", "start": 679.279, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "World Bank, the Asian Development Bank,", "start": 682.56, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "and the UN agencies. We thank our", "start": 686.32, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "partners and look forward to advancing", "start": 690.24, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "our shared interest under the forums", "start": 693.36, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "outcome document.", "start": 696.24, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "We call the Christmas Partnership Accord", "start": 698.48, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "2026.", "start": 702.079, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "Mr. President, ultimately development", "start": 704.0, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "depends on people, our most valuable", "start": 707.2, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "resource, making education a vital", "start": 710.56, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "investment. Gilas is committed to", "start": 713.519, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "expanding access to quality, inclusive,", "start": 716.079, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "relevant education while strengthening", "start": 719.839, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "skills, development, skills development,", "start": 722.8, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "vocational training. digital learning", "start": 726.32, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "and opportunities for young people.", "start": 729.519, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "Health is equally fundamental. We", "start": 732.639, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "continue to strengthen our health", "start": 736.0, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "systems across our widely dispersed and", "start": 738.16, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "remote silence, improve access to", "start": 742.16, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "essential services, and address both", "start": 745.04, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "communicable and non-communicable", "start": 747.839, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "diseases. Healthy and educated", "start": 750.959, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "population is the foundation upon which", "start": 754.399, "duration": 9.041}, {"text": "every other national priority rest.", "start": 758.48, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "Mr. President, we cannot speak about", "start": 763.44, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "development with without speaking about", "start": 766.48, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "women and youth. Gilibus remains", "start": 769.2, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "committed to gender equality and", "start": 772.72, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "empowering women and girls. Our election", "start": 775.44, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "earlier this year to the commission on", "start": 779.44, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "the status of women. The first time", "start": 782.079, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "Kibas has secured a seat on this UN body", "start": 785.44, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "is a significant milestone reflecting", "start": 789.36, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "our determination to advance women's", "start": 792.48, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "rights nationally and globally. We will", "start": 795.68, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "expand opportunities, prevent violence,", "start": 799.44, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "and promote women's economic empowerment", "start": 802.72, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "and leadership. Our youth meanwhile", "start": 805.76, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "represent not simply the future of", "start": 809.68, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Kiribas. We must provide them with", "start": 811.839, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "education, employment, skills,", "start": 814.32, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "technology, leadership opportunities and", "start": 818.16, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "spaces where they can contribute and one", "start": 821.839, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "of those spaces is sport. Gilibas will", "start": 825.12, "duration": 8.56}, {"text": "lost the 2030 Micronian Games which we", "start": 829.36, "duration": 7.839}, {"text": "intend to use to leave a lasting legacy", "start": 833.68, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "for our young people. We invite our", "start": 837.199, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "regional and international partners to", "start": 840.399, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "join us in this endeavor", "start": 843.76, "duration": 7.4}, {"text": "for kibbas", "start": 847.839, "duration": 3.321}, {"text": "on peace and security.", "start": 852.32, "duration": 3.959}, {"text": "Mr. President, Kilibus is a peaceful", "start": 859.04, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "nation. Yet distance does not make a", "start": 861.839, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "difference to the suffering caused by", "start": 865.279, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "war and conflicts elsewhere. The people", "start": 867.839, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "of every nation deserve peace. We", "start": 871.519, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "reaffirm that disputes must be resolved", "start": 874.639, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "peacefully in accordance with the", "start": 877.92, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "international law and the principles of", "start": 880.24, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "the United Nations chart. For highland", "start": 883.279, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "nations such as Gibbus, respect for", "start": 886.72, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "international law is fundamental to our", "start": 889.68, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "security, sovereignty, and stability of", "start": 893.04, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "the international system. Gibbus is", "start": 896.639, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "proud to contribute in our own way to", "start": 899.44, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "international peace and security through", "start": 903.04, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "the service of our police officers under", "start": 906.079, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "the United Nations flag. For Kibas, this", "start": 908.639, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "is an expression of our belief that even", "start": 912.8, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "the smallest country can contribute to", "start": 915.76, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "global peace. For Pacific people, the", "start": 919.04, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "consequences of nuclear weapons are not", "start": 922.959, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "mis merely historical. Our region bears", "start": 925.519, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "the human and environmental legacy of", "start": 929.199, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "nuclear testing. uh state parties to the", "start": 932.32, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "treaty on the prohibition of nuclear", "start": 935.6, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "weapons. We remain committed to", "start": 938.48, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "advancing the treaties and human", "start": 940.8, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "humanitarian objectives and establishing", "start": 943.279, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "an international trust fund for nuclear", "start": 946.48, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "weapons victims. As co-chairs with", "start": 949.519, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Kazakhstan of the recent international", "start": 952.56, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "meeting on victim assistance and", "start": 955.519, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "environmental remediation, we thank the", "start": 958.72, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "Secretary General for convening this", "start": 961.759, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "important meeting and for keeping the", "start": 964.399, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "needs of affected communities at the", "start": 966.959, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "center of our collective efforts.", "start": 969.839, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "Peace and security must also keep pace", "start": 973.36, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "with emerging threats in the digital", "start": 976.24, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "domain. The his Micronian cable landed", "start": 979.6, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "in Tarawa last year connecting Gilibas", "start": 983.519, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "with NU and the federated state of", "start": 986.32, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "Micronia transforming our connectivity", "start": 989.04, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "and digital environment. However, it", "start": 992.72, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "also creates vulnerabilities", "start": 996.24, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "with limited redundancy and technical", "start": 998.88, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "capacity. Island states face threats", "start": 1001.279, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "including cyber crime, critical", "start": 1005.839, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "infrastructure attacks and ransomware", "start": 1008.88, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "and online harms that can undermine", "start": 1012.16, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "security and development.", "start": 1015.519, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Your excellencies", "start": 1019.68, "duration": 5.999}, {"text": "Gibbus comes to this assembly not simply", "start": 1021.519, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "to speak of the challenges we face. We", "start": 1025.679, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "come here. We come to speak of the", "start": 1028.799, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "future we choose. Allow me to to close,", "start": 1031.28, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "Mr. President, by bestowing upon the", "start": 1036.0, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "United Nations and all its members and", "start": 1038.799, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "all its staff our traditional blessings", "start": 1042.16, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "of the Maui, the Roy", "start": 1045.199, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "meaning abundant health, peace and", "start": 1048.72, "duration": 8.52}, {"text": "prosperity. I thank you.", "start": 1052.32, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "On behalf of the assembly, I wish to", "start": 1062.64, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "thank the president and minister of", "start": 1064.72, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "foreign affairs and immigration of the", "start": 1066.48, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "republic of Kibati.", "start": 1068.72, "duration": 3.56}]